RX8E to Posibus Adapter per Ulrich Fierz
<UL>
<LI><b>rx08-ulrich</b> is a schematic for Ulrich Fierz's modifications to
an 8/i and a TC08 to interface the RX8E.</LI>
<LI><b>pbusRX8E</b> is an attempt to modify Ulrich's design to remove the 
8/i dependency.</LI>
<LI><b>rx08-vrs</b> is another attempt to modify Ulrich's design to remove 
the 8/i dependency, and makes the Omnibus connections more explicit.</LI>
